{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》今晚（9日）在港首播，眾演員包括楊茜堯、陳展鵬、陳豪、馬國明、林夏薇、姚子羚、陳自瑤、陳楨怡等盛裝出席首播活動，他們分組行紅地氈出場，林夏薇、姚子羚與傅嘉莉現場獻唱片尾曲《大娛樂家》。</p><p>總監製鍾澍佳將首播的心情比喻為開六</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.404456+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T14:32:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T18:38:53.475721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"6476691bb1a2375b7cdbb7456f2ad14411405b66ef5ae1e025e6ecbe679aeba4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}